[dns]
no-ipv6
server=223.5.5.5
server=119.29.29.29
doh-server=https://dns.alidns.com/dns-query
doh-server=https://doh.pub/dns-query

[policy]
# Two-stage node filter (⚡ 自动选择): include=.* | exclude=(?i)(?:流量|到期|官网|官網|剩余|剩餘|过期|過期|重置|套餐|公告|群组|群組|失联|失聯|网址|網址|最新域名|订阅|訂閱|客服|续费|續費|频道|頻道|防失联|Traffic|Expire|Expired|Reset|Website|Official|Remaining|Bandwidth|Support|Channel)
